What is Freeze Drying Technology?
Freeze Drying Technology is a state of the art preservation method that removes water from products at sub freezing temperatures and reduced pressure, ensuring that sensitive ingredients retain their bioactivity, texture, and flavor. Primarily used in pharmaceutical and food industries, lyophilization extends shelf life, eliminates cold chain requirements, and supports the global distribution of injectable biologics, vaccines, and high value nutraceuticals.
